# Build and upload-check toolchain for the release workflow, hash-pinned so
# the published distributions are built by a known hatchling. The workflow
# builds with `python -m build --no-isolation`, which uses this hatchling
# instead of fetching an unpinned one into an isolated environment.
# Regenerate:
#   uv pip compile --generate-hashes --universal --python-version 3.10 \
#     requirements/build.in -o requirements/build.txt
